        "Description": "After an assasination went south in brussels ending with a mass shooting, Alma Reynard and her small group of mercenary assasins were forced to retreat into a small villa on the shore of hawkes bay in new zealand. Your task is to eliminate the people directly responsible for the shooting. on completion a sum of 50,000 merces will be transferred to your account. Oh, and delete the camera footage, evidence cannot get out that we are starting to search for their clients.",
